/*
 * Implements semantic validation for global variable declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of external global variables,
 *   - validation of module-local global variables,
 *   - lazy-initialization semantics for globals,
 *   - type validation and inference for global declarations,
 *   - memory-ownership verification for global values,
 *   - detection of forward-reference cycles,
 *   - construction of GlobalVarGenerator entries,
 *   - insertion of global generators into the validation context.
 *
 * Global variables may be:
 *   - extern globals(declared but not defined),
 *   - lazy locals(module-local globals with lazy initialization),
 *   - thread-local globals.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::global
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/global.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-12-09
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
